   "long_face_m": 150.0,
   "note": "The two pictured hydrants where their pictures put them (Pullman's on the Prairie Avenue parkway beside the walk north of 18th Street, Tucker's near the curb toward 22nd Street); then one at every other intersection, at its corners taken in turn, on the avenue's parkway 3.5 m from the corner and 0.45 m inside the curb; and one mid-block on one side of every block face 150 m long or more. Each stands in the grass, clear of the walks, the corner crossings, the carriage walks, the lamps and the elms."
  }
